  'review of PR 4583 reproduced with the real jobBreachDoctorWatch and the real chaosJudge on node:sqlite: a healthy doctor gave a drill ok, a doctor tick 47 minutes old with a live watch gave watch ok, stalled, file-issue, one issue, event status ok and a drill fail with doctor_tick_age_min reads 47 minutes, above the limit of 30; qnfo-audit 2026-10-26T11:22Z (SELECT only): the old probe is on D1 and has never run, alternate_tested_at is NULL, the watch heartbeat was written 2026-10-26T11:20:55Z and doctor_tick_age_min was last refreshed 2026-10-26T11:20:55Z',
